        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Beaches in the U.K. are becoming safer for seals! A "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "coastal council",
            "ref": "v-coastal-council"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has banned plastic flying rings from local beaches. The rings can be dangerous for young seals. If a seal puts its head through a ring, it can get "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stuck",
            "ref": "v-stuck"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This can cause "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "injuries",
            "zh": "伤害"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or even death."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The ban is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "voluntary",
            "ref": "v-voluntary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That means there will be no "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fines",
            "ref": "v-fine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " if someone brings a plastic ring to the beach. Some big shops near the coast have stopped selling the rings. But people can still play on the beach using safe toys, like "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "solid frisbees",
            "ref": "v-solid-frisbee"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that are not made of plastic."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A wildlife group now wants the government to stop the sale of plastic flying rings across the country. Many people "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "support",
            "ref": "v-support"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this. “Flying rings are a risk for seals,” said an animal lover. “If we use safer toys, we can help protect these beautiful animals.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
